{"4451920": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Galdromeda", "steam_appid": 4451920, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Galdromeda you take command of a spaceship. You get lost in an unknown galaxy and try to find your way back home. You meet and recruit new crew members to help you on your journey as you uncover the secrets of this galaxy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire crew members</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 8 crew members. Each with 5 unique skills to help you in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/88654c7d13ad2fde1647562b2c2f01ab.avif?t=1785130869\" width=1196 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging turn-based combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover skill synergies, exploit enemy weakness, and get good at timing your dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/1158fc2edd5a43d5536161373e1900c3.poster.avif?t=1785130869\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/1158fc2edd5a43d5536161373e1900c3.webm?t=1785130869\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/1158fc2edd5a43d5536161373e1900c3.mp4?t=1785130869\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Collect</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect cool outfits and trinkets for your crew members. Collect up to 3 outfits and trinkets per character, not counting their default outfit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/4b253797d8fa1dde715bc54123c90349.avif?t=1785130869\" width=1007 height=400 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your ship with circuits and a passive skill tree. Upgrade your crew member's skills with their own skill trees. Try different builds and experiment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/4df1e2d974e5298af78bf54fb931978c.avif?t=1785130869\" width=1000 height=449 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game size</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One playthrough is around 5 hours. There are 8 star systems, and maximum level is 30.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Galdromeda you take command of a spaceship. You get lost in an unknown galaxy and try to find your way back home. You meet and recruit new crew members to help you on your journey as you uncover the secrets of this galaxy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Hire crew members</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock up to 8 crew members. Each with 5 unique skills to help you in battle. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/88654c7d13ad2fde1647562b2c2f01ab.avif?t=1785130869\" width=1196 height=296 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Engaging turn-based combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover skill synergies, exploit enemy weakness, and get good at timing your dodge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4451920/extras/1158fc2edd5a43d5536161373e1900c3.poster.avif?t=1785130869\" width=1170 height=284 ><source src=\"